  "graphs": {
    "creature": {
      "note": "The game sets act, speed (world m/s), hit and the look target; the graph picks and blends the clips. ragdoll (set with props.ragdoll; ragdoll_set does both) blends into the physics pose and back out to whatever act says. Knee limits: straight is the rest bend backwards (33.8 deg).",
